   "source": [
    "# KonkaniVani ASR - Model Finetuning from Checkpoint\n",
    "\n",
    "## What This Notebook Does:\n",
    "- ✅ Loads a pre-trained .pt model checkpoint\n",
    "- ✅ Finetunes it with improved hyperparameters\n",
    "- ✅ Advanced training techniques for better accuracy\n",
    "- ✅ Periodic evaluation and testing\n",
    "- ✅ Automatic best model selection\n",
    "\n",
    "## Expected Improvements:\n",
    "- Better transcription accuracy\n",
    "- Reduced blank token probability\n",
    "- More stable training convergence\n",
    "- Enhanced model performance"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "40eb24b3",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## Step 1: Setup Environment"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
