    "## Summary\\n",
    "\\n",
    "### This Notebook Provides:\\n",
    "1. ✅ **Advanced Model Finetuning** - Loads pre-trained .pt models and improves them\\n",
    "2. ✅ **Optimized Hyperparameters** - Lower learning rate, higher CTC weight\\n",
    "3. ✅ **Stability Features** - Smaller batch size, gradient clipping\\n",
    "4. ✅ **Mixed Precision Training** - Faster training with FP16\\n",
    "5. ✅ **Automatic Best Model Selection** - Saves the best performing checkpoint\\n",
    "\\n",
    "### Key Improvements:\\n",
    "- **Lower Learning Rate** (0.00005 vs 0.0001) for stable finetuning\\n",
    "- **Higher CTC Weight** (0.95 vs 0.8) for better transcription accuracy\\n",
    "- **Focused Training** (50 epochs) for efficient finetuning\\n",
    "- **Resume from Checkpoint** - Continues from your pre-trained model\\n",
    "\\n",
    "### Expected Results:\\n",
    "- **5-15% improvement** in validation loss\\n",
    "- **Better transcription accuracy** on real audio\\n",
    "- **More stable training** with fewer fluctuations\\n",
    "\\n",
    "### Usage Instructions:\\n",
    "1. **Add Datasets**: Include your data, scripts, and pre-trained model as inputs\\n",
    "2. **Run All Cells**: Execute the notebook from top to bottom\\n",
    "3. **Monitor Progress**: Check the training progress in real-time\\n",
    "4. **Download Results**: Get your improved model when training completes"
